{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793089550753,"sessionID":"ses_e838fafdfffe3LhjKrXU2o8Kh0","part":{"partID":"prt_17c7736c30022tler1CwwanKCN","sessionID":"ses_e838fafdfffe3LhjKrXU2o8Kh0","messageID":"msg_17c770da5001k8wzDYJVtbVlCw","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-81aba412d4c90967","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public && echo \"== hooksPath\" && git config --get core.hooksPath; echo \"== global hooks dir\" && ls -la ~/.config/git/hooks/ 2>/dev/null | head; echo \"== pre-push gate block\" && grep -n -B4 -A20 \"SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_SKILL_GATE\" ~/.config/git/hooks/pre-push 2>/dev/null | head -60"},"output":"== hooksPath\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.config/git/hooks\n== global hooks dir\ntotal 0\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 9 michelkerkmeester  staff  288 Oct 23 22:41 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 michelkerkmeester  staff  128 Sep 17 22:18 ..\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  103 Oct 23 22:41 commit-msg -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/commit-msg\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  104 Oct 23 22:41 post-commit -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/post-commit\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  103 Oct 23 22:41 post-merge -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/post-merge\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  105 Oct 23 22:41 post-rewrite -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/post-rewrite\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  103 Oct 23 22:41 pre-commit -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  101 Oct 23 22:41 pre-push -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/pre-push\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  111 Oct 23 22:41 prepare-commit-msg -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/prepare-commit-msg\n== pre-push gate block\n12-#                      live-branch autosync publish (SPECKIT_AUTOSYNC=1 with\n13-#                      SPECKIT_LIVE_BRANCH=<branch>) passes for updates to\n14-#                      that one branch.\n15-#   Skill metadata:    warns when skill changes leave root metadata stale;\n16:#                      never blocks (SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_SKILL_GATE=1 skips).\n17-#   Compiled routing:  the route guard must pass, and a pushed commit that is\n18-#                      HEAD must carry the routing bytes the guard approved\n19-#                      (SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_ROUTE_GATE=1 skips both).\n20-#   Track roots:       each pushed ref's tip must have track roots that list\n21-#                      exactly the packets they hold\n22-#                      (SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_TRACK_GATE=1 skips).\n23-#   Message contract:  every commit the push adds and every new branch name\n24-#                      must meet the rules the repository's own templates\n25-#                      declare. This is what catches a commit made with\n26-#                      --no-verify, and it has no bypass.\n27-#   Commit-Id:         in every repository lib/commit-id-policy.sh covers,\n28-#                      each non-merge commit the push adds must carry a\n29-#                      Commit-Id; no bypass, but git config --local\n30-#                      skilled.commitId false exempts the repository.\n31-#\n32-# The gates are independently bypassable; skipping one never skips another.\n33-# The hooks are installed machine-wide. Scripts from a repository's own tree run\n34-# only in the checkout the hooks live in (or one of its worktrees), or where the\n35-# repository's local config sets skilled.trustRepoHooks=true.\n36-#\n--\n420-# `ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs --fix`.\n421-#\n422-# The gate reads the working tree, which on a normal push from a clean worktree\n423-# is exactly what is being pushed. A deliberately partial push from a dirty\n424:# tree can skip with SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_SKILL_GATE=1.\n425:if [[ \"${SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_SKILL_GATE:-0}\" != \"1\" ]]; then\n426-  SKILL_GATE=\"$SOURCE_ROOT/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs\"\n427-  # Per-ref ranges avoid coupling a live-branch publish to the wrapper branch's\n428-  # upstream configuration. New remote branches still defer to CI because they\n429-  # have no prior remote tree to compare without scanning an unrelated history.\n430-  if [[ \"$SKILL_CHANGES_PUSHED\" -eq 1 && ! -f \"$SKILL_GATE\" ]]; then\n431-    # Only a checkout that ships the toolchain has a checker to miss.\n432-    if _in_toolchain_repo; then\n433-      echo \"WARNING [gate:skill-root-metadata]: checker is missing: $SKILL_GATE; push gate failed open.\" >&2\n434-    fi\n435-  elif [[ -f \"$SKILL_GATE\" && \"$SKILL_CHANGES_PUSHED\" -eq 1 ]]; then\n436-    if ! node \"$SKILL_GATE\" >&2; then\n437-      {\n438-        echo \"\"\n439-        if [[ \"$AUTOSYNC_LIVE_PUSH\" -eq 1 ]]; then\n440-          echo \"WARNING [gate:skill-root-metadata]: this live-branch publish carries stale skill metadata.\"\n441-          echo \"Not blocking: the hook cannot regenerate committed bytes, and CI enforces this on main and skilled/v*.\"\n442-        else\n443-          echo \"WARNING [gate:skill-root-metadata]: skill-root metadata is stale for skills being pushed.\"\n444-          echo \"Not blocking: CI enforces this on every push to main and skilled/v*.\"\n445-        fi\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"== hooksPath\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/.config/git/hooks\n== global hooks dir\ntotal 0\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 9 michelkerkmeester  staff  288 Oct 23 22:41 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 michelkerkmeester  staff  128 Sep 17 22:18 ..\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  103 Oct 23 22:41 commit-msg -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/commit-msg\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  104 Oct 23 22:41 post-commit -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/post-commit\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  103 Oct 23 22:41 post-merge -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/post-merge\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  105 Oct 23 22:41 post-rewrite -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/post-rewrite\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  103 Oct 23 22:41 pre-commit -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  101 Oct 23 22:41 pre-push -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/pre-push\nlrwxr-xr-x@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff  111 Oct 23 22:41 prepare-commit-msg -> /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.skilled/scripts/git-hooks/prepare-commit-msg\n== pre-push gate block\n12-#                      live-branch autosync publish (SPECKIT_AUTOSYNC=1 with\n13-#                      SPECKIT_LIVE_BRANCH=<branch>) passes for updates to\n14-#                      that one branch.\n15-#   Skill metadata:    warns when skill changes leave root metadata stale;\n16:#                      never blocks (SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_SKILL_GATE=1 skips).\n17-#   Compiled routing:  the route guard must pass, and a pushed commit that is\n18-#                      HEAD must carry the routing bytes the guard approved\n19-#                      (SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_ROUTE_GATE=1 skips both).\n20-#   Track roots:       each pushed ref's tip must have track roots that list\n21-#                      exactly the packets they hold\