{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793089591438,"sessionID":"ses_e838fafdfffe3LhjKrXU2o8Kh0","part":{"partID":"prt_17c77c8ff0014lN8tFdBzRDcbk","sessionID":"ses_e838fafdfffe3LhjKrXU2o8Kh0","messageID":"msg_17c77a625001UZn8jVHDKG5KNq","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8182a00444be8c3e","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-1017-1793088864734-4s5169\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-1017-1793088864734-4s5169\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-1017-1793088864734-4s5169\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.8,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Every unbounded git call site, and the safest default posture\",\"findingsCount\":11,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All eleven findings are new to the packet: the hook chain, the exact fallback gap, the in-repo opt-out convention, the further call sites and the reaping design were unrecorded.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Q1. What unset speckit.worktreeBase and removed the reaper's daemon handling, and does anything still create worktrees under .worktrees/ by default?\",\"Q2. What is git 2.50.1's documented fsmonitor daemon lifecycle on macOS, and how do fsmonitor.socketDir, idle shutdown and git fsmonitor--daemon stop behave when the daemon is wedged?\",\"Q3. Is event overload the real cause of the hang, or is there a known daemon deadlock in this git version, for example around --ipc-threads or the cookie-file handshake?\",\"Q4. Which call sites in the repo's hooks and scripts run git without a timeout, and which of them should opt out of fsmonitor?\",\"Q5. What is the safest default: fsmonitor on with worktrees outside the checkout, or fsmonitor off for the main checkout and on per worktree?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Q4. Which call sites in the repo's hooks and scripts run git without a timeout, and which of them should opt out of fsmonitor?\",\"Q5. What is the safest default: fsmonitor on with worktrees outside the checkout, or fsmonitor off for the main checkout and on per worktree?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Restore the reaper's daemon handling\",\"Rely on git fsmonitor--daemon stop in a reaper\",\"Match daemons by command line\",\"Disable fsmonitor everywhere\"],\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs:51\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:129\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:136\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/regenerate-skill-derived.cjs:73\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/scripts/verify-router-sync.cjs:168\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-hook-gates.cjs:180\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/release-update.cjs:282\",\".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/validate-message.mjs:88\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/behavior-benchmark/behavior-bench-run.cjs:885\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-source-tags-helper.mjs:53\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/cite-drift-scan.mjs:145\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/continuity-freshness.ts:38\",\"~/.config/git/hooks/pre-push:425\"],\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-27T08:27:00Z\",\"durationMs\":0,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q4-call-sites\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Unbounded git call sites in hooks and scripts\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q5-safe-default\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Safest fsmonitor default posture\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-manifest-check-ignore-unbounded\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"generate-leaf-manifest check-ignore has no timeout and no fsmonitor opt-out\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-optout-convention-exists\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"GIT_NO_FSMONITOR convention already exists in three modules\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-daemons-argv-identical\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Every daemon argv is identical so reaping needs the socket path\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q4-1\",\"source\":\"f-manifest-check-ignore-unbounded\",\"target\":\"q4-call-sites\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q4-2\",\"source\":\"f-optout-convention-exists\",\"target\":\"f-manifest-check-ignore-unbounded\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q5-1\",\"source\":\"f-daemons-argv-identical\",\"target\":\"q5-safe-default\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"label\":\"The hung hop is the manifest builder: ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs:51 imports buildManifestBytes from generate-leaf-manifest.cjs, so the pre-push skill gate's runtime is dominated by that builder's git calls.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs:51\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"label\":\"generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:129 spawns git check-ignore -z --stdin with no timeout and no core.fsmonitor=false, so it takes the unbounded IPC path documented in iteration 2.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:129\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"The existing fallback at generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:136 requires a returned result, so a hanging spawnSync never reaches it; adding a timeout alone makes the fallback reachable.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:136\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"The repo already defines GIT_NO_FSMONITOR = [-c, core.fsmonitor=false] in check-source-tags-helper.mjs:53, cite-drift-scan.mjs:145 and continuity-freshness.ts:38; the hung path simply never adopted it.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-source-tags-helper.mjs:53\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/cite-drift-scan.mjs:145\",\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/continuity-freshness.ts:38\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"Additional unbounded index-reading automation call sites: regenerate-skill-derived.cjs:73, verify-router-sync.cjs:168, doctor/git-hook-gates.cjs:180, doctor/release-update.cjs:282, sk-git/validate-message.mjs:88 and behavior-bench-run.cjs:885.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/regenerate-skill-derived.cjs:73\",\".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/scripts/verify-router-sync.cjs:168\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/git-hook-gates.cjs:180\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/release-update.cjs:282\",\".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/validate-message.mjs:88\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/shared/behavior-benchmark/behavior-bench-run.cjs:885\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"core.hooksPath is ~/.config/git/hooks, every entry symlinks into .skilled/scripts/git-hooks, and the skill gate is skippable only by SPECKIT_SKIP_PREPUSH_SKILL_GATE=1, so a timeout here fixes every machine checkout that trusts repo hooks.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"~/.config/git/hooks/pre-push:425\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"label\":\"Daemon-to-worktree attribution cannot use argv: every daemon runs exactly fsmonitor--daemon run --detach --ipc-threads=8 with no path, so the reaper must resolve the socket each process holds open instead.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"ps -Ao pid,lstart,command\",\"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/scratch/findings.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-008\",\"label\":\"Recovery must escalate past stop: because git fsmonitor--daemon stop polls forever on a wedged daemon, a reaper must bound the stop, then SIGTERM, then SIGKILL.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:129\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-009\",\"label\":\"Safest default is fsmonitor on only with worktrees outside the checkout, opted-out time-bounded automation and a daemon reaper; without all three, off for the main checkout via extensions.worktreeConfig and git config --worktree core.fsmonitor false.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/bin/worktree-session.sh:292\",\"builtin/fsmonitor--daemon.c:198\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-010\",\"label\":\"Prevention invariant: no fsmonitor daemon may outlive its worktree and no automated git call may wait without a ceiling, enforced at worktree removal, in a stray-daemon reap and in a bounded wedge probe.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/bin/worktree-reaper.sh\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:136\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-011\",\"label\":\"The highest-leverage single change is bounding and opting out the hook's check-ignore, which converts a wedged daemon into a fast gate warning through the existing fallback; relocation and reaping then remove the recurrence.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:129\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:136\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Restore the reaper's daemon handling\",\"reason\":\"The deleted code targeted MCP context-server daemons and the current reaper promises never to signal a process.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Rely on git fsmonitor--daemon stop in a reaper\",\"reason\":\"stop polls forever on a wedged daemon, so it cannot be the escalation path by itself.\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Match daemons by command line\",\"reason\":\"All daemons share identical argv; the socket path is the only attribution key.\",\"iteration\":3}\n","path":"specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-1017/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-1017/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/sk-git/035-fsmonitor-daemon-and-worktree-relocation-regression/001-deep-research/research/lineages/llmgateway-flash-1017/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"run\\\":3,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-1017-1793088864734-4s5169\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-1017-1793088864734-4s5169\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-llmgateway-flash-1017-1793088864734-4s5169\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.8,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Every unbounded git call site, and the safest default posture\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":11,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All eleven findings are new to the packet: the hook chain, the exact fallback gap, the in-repo opt-out convention, the further call sites and the reaping design were unrecorded.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Q1. What unset speckit.worktreeBase and removed the reaper's daemon handling, and does anything still create worktrees under .worktrees/ by default?\\\",\\\"Q2. What is git 2.50.1's documented fsmonitor daemon lifecycle on macOS, and how do fsmo